    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Confidence in a Time of Crisis"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "For the choir director: according to Jeduthun. Of Asaph. A psalm."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I cry aloud to God,",
          "aloud to God, and he will hear me."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I sought the Lord in my day of trouble.",
          "My hands were continually lifted up",
          "all night long;",
          "I refused to be comforted."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I think of God; I groan;",
          "I meditate; my spirit becomes weak."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Selah"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "You have kept me from closing my eyes;",
          "I am troubled and cannot speak."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I consider days of old,",
          "years long past."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "At night I remember my music;",
          "I meditate in my heart, and my spirit ponders."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“Will the Lord reject forever",
          "and never again show favor?"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Has his faithful love ceased forever?",
          "Is his promise at an end for all generations?"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Has God forgotten to be gracious?",
          "Has he in anger withheld his compassion? ”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Selah"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "So I say, “I am grieved",
          "that the right hand of the Most High has changed.” ,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I will remember the Lord’s works;",
          "yes, I will remember your ancient wonders."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I will reflect on all you have done",
          "and meditate on your actions."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "God, your way is holy.",
          "What god is great like God?"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "You are the God who works wonders;",
          "you revealed your strength among the peoples."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          15
        ],
        "lines": [
          "With power you redeemed your people,",
          "the descendants of Jacob and Joseph."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Selah"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          16
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The water saw you, God.",
          "The water saw you; it trembled.",
          "Even the depths shook."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          17
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The clouds poured down water.",
          "The storm clouds thundered;",
          "your arrows flashed back and forth."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          18
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The sound of your thunder was in the whirlwind;",
          "lightning lit up the world.",
          "The earth shook and quaked."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          19
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Your way went through the sea",
          "and your path through the vast water,",
          "but your footprints were unseen."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          20
        ],
        "lines": [
          "You led your people like a flock",
          "by the hand of Moses and Aaron."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
